<view class="hero"><view class="hi">合作中心</view><view class="sub2">按授权主体查询项目与分润 · 门店岗位独立授权</view></view>
<view class="card state-error" wx:if="{{error}}"><view>{{error}}</view><button class="btn ghost sm" bindtap="load">重试</button></view>
<view class="skeleton" wx:if="{{loading}}" style="height:240rpx"></view>
<view class="card empty" wx:if="{{!subjects.length && !error && !loading}}"><view class="e-ico">🤝</view>暂无有效合作授权<view class="note">如有合作意向，请联系平台运营开通</view></view>
<view class="card fade-up" wx:for="{{subjects}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="choose"><view class="wk-subject">{{item.name}}</view><view class="note">查看此主体的项目与分润 ›</view></view>
<view class="card fade-up" wx:if="{{current}}">
  <view class="sec-title">当前主体：{{current.name}}</view>
  <view class="kv" wx:for="{{resources}}" wx:key="id"><text>{{item.label}}</text><text>{{item.name}}</text></view>
  <view class="note">{{note}}</view>
</view>
<view class="card fade-up" wx:if="{{current}}">
  <view class="kv"><picker mode="date" bindchange="queryInput" data-field="from"><text class="wk-picker">{{from || '分润开始日期'}}</text></picker><picker mode="date" bindchange="queryInput" data-field="to"><text class="wk-picker">{{to || '截止日期'}}</text></picker></view>
  <input class="wk-input" type="number" value="{{productId}}" placeholder="分润产品编号（留空查全部）" bindinput="queryInput" data-field="productId"/>
  <button class="btn primary sm" bindtap="applyQuery">按条件查询</button>
</view>
<view class="card fade-up" wx:if="{{projects.length}}">
  <view class="sec-title">关联项目与当前合同</view>
  <view wx:for="{{projects}}" wx:key="id" class="wk-project">
    <view class="kv"><text>{{item.title}}</text><text>{{item.status === 1 ? '在售' : '已停售'}}</text></view>
    <view wx:for="{{item.contracts}}" wx:for-item="c" wx:key="id" class="wk-contract">
      <view class="kv"><text>我的角色</text><text>{{c.roleText}} · {{c.status === 1 ? '合作生效' : '合作停用'}}</text></view>
      <view class="kv"><text>登记投入</text><text>¥{{c.investText}}</text></view>
      <view class="kv"><text>当前分润比例</text><text>{{c.shareText}}</text></view>
      <view class="kv"><text>合作协议</text><text>{{c.contractNo || '未登记'}} · {{c.from || '待核实'}} — {{c.to || '待核实'}}</text></view>
      <view class="kv"><text>收款账户</text><text>尾号 {{c.payoutTail || '未登记'}} · 变更请联系平台</text></view>
      <view class="note" wx:if="{{c.note}}">{{c.note}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
<view class="card fade-up" wx:for="{{profits}}" wx:key="id">
  <view class="sec-title">{{item.title}} · {{item.period}}</view>
  <view class="kv"><text>分润基数（对账用）</text><text>¥{{item.baseText}} × {{item.shareText}}</text></view>
  <view class="kv"><text>对账编号</text><text>{{item.settlement_id}} · 第{{item.version}}版</text></view>
  <view class="kv"><text>本期应付</text><text class="wk-amount">¥{{item.amountText}}</text></view>
  <view class="kv"><text>已登记支付</text><text>¥{{item.paidText}}</text></view>
  <view class="kv"><text>待付 / 有效冲正</text><text>¥{{item.pendingText}} / ¥{{item.adjustText}}</text></view>
  <view class="wk-state">{{item.statusText}}</view>
  <view class="wk-actions"><button class="btn ghost sm" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="loadPayments">付款与回单</button><button class="btn ghost sm" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="sendFeedback">对账反馈</button></view>
</view>
<view class="card fade-up" wx:for="{{payments}}" wx:key="id">
  <view class="kv"><text>{{item.direction === 2 ? '冲正' : '付款'}}</text><text class="wk-amount">¥{{item.amountText}} · {{item.statusText}}</text></view>
  <view class="note">{{item.pay_date}} · 流水号 {{item.pay_ref}}</view>
  <view class="note" wx:if="{{item.note}}">{{item.note}}</view>
  <button wx:if="{{item.hasReceipt}}" class="btn ghost sm" bindtap="receipt" data-id="{{item.id}}">查看回单 ›</button>
</view>
<view class="card empty" wx:if="{{current && !profits.length}}"><view class="e-ico">📄</view>暂无本主体分润记录</view>
<view class="chips" wx:if="{{current}}"><button wx:if="{{page>1}}" class="btn ghost sm" bindtap="prev">上一页</button><text class="muted">第{{page}}页 · 分润{{total}}条</text><button wx:if="{{hasNext}}" class="btn ghost sm" bindtap="next">下一页</button></view>
<view class="card fade-up" wx:for="{{feedback}}" wx:key="id"><view class="kv"><text>对账反馈</text><text>{{item.detail}}</text></view><view class="note">{{item.replyText}}</view></view>
